---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="The SOP Playbook — Free Process Call for Law Firm Owners"
  description="Ten processes to write down before you hand anything off. Book a free call and find out which of the ten is costing your firm the most hours."
  noindex={true}
  schema={{
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "name": "The SOP Playbook",
    "description": "A free staffing call for law firm owners about the ten one-page SOPs to document before handing off work.",
    "publisher": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Attorney Assistant"
    }
  }}
>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       HERO
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-950 min-h-[90vh] flex items-center">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy via-brand-900 to-brand-950"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--1" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--2" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--3" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-[1] opacity-[0.03]" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 60px 60px;"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10 py-20 lg:py-28">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="reveal">
          <div class="mb-5">
            <span class="lp-pulse-badge">
              <span class="lp-pulse-dot"></span>
              For Law Firm Owners
            </span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-display-md md:text-display-lg lg:text-display-xl font-heading text-white leading-tight mb-5">
            "I'll just do it myself" <span class="text-gradient-gold">is a documentation problem.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            Ten processes to write down before you hand anything off &mdash; the exact ten, in the order to write them, with the format already filled in.
          </p>

          <!-- Stat ticker -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-10">
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="10">0</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">one-page SOPs that cover a firm's first 40 small tasks</span>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="5">0</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">fields on every SOP &mdash; that's the whole format</span>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="20">0</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">minutes to write one, recording included</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- What the call covers -->
          <div class="space-y-4 mb-10">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">On Your Call We'll Cover</p>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 13.5l10.5-11.25L12 10.5h8.25L9.75 21.75 12 13.5H3.75z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Which of your tasks actually belong in an SOP</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">A four-question test, run against your real week. Most owners find 20 to 30 tasks that pass.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 18L9 11.25l4.306 4.306a11.95 11.95 0 015.814-5.518l2.74-1.22m0 0l-5.94-2.281m5.94 2.28l-2.28 5.941" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">The order to write them in</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Intake first, because it's where the money leaks. Money last, because it's the one most owners avoid.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">How a trained person runs on them from day one</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Written for a trained person, not a stranger. Once they've read two, they can follow all ten.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-400">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Free &mdash; 30 minutes
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              No commitment
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Built inside a working law firm
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Booking Widget -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-1 shadow-2xl ring-1 ring-white/10 reveal lp-widget-glow" style="transition-delay: 150ms" id="book-now">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 md:p-5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <div class="featured-icon featured-icon-md featured-icon-gold">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-heading text-gray-900">Book Your Staffing Call</h2>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Free &mdash; 30 minutes</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="meetings-iframe-container" data-src="https://meet.attorneyassistant.com/meetings/attorney-assistant/the-sop-playbook?embed=true"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 lp-scroll-hint" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="w-6 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-white/20 flex justify-center pt-2">
        <div class="w-1 h-2.5 bg-brand-gold rounded-full lp-scroll-dot"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       OPENING — the story + the four-question test
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gray-950 lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-gold/5 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-red-500/3 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
        <!-- Left: Story -->
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="badge bg-brand-gold/15 text-brand-gold border-brand-gold/20 mb-6">Read This First</span>
          <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-white mb-5 leading-tight">
            It's faster to do it yourself because the only copy of the process is in your head.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Explaining it takes longer than doing it, so you do it, and the task never leaves your desk. Multiply that by forty small tasks and you have a firm owner working 60 hours a week on $25-an-hour work.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            The fix is not a procedures manual. Nobody reads a procedures manual. The fix is ten one-page SOPs, each short enough to write in 20 minutes and clear enough that a trained person can follow it on their first day.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xl font-heading text-brand-gold">
            The firm's way of doing things should live on a page, not in the owner.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: is this task ready to hand off -->
        <div class="reveal space-y-4" style="transition-delay: 150ms">
          <div class="lp-pain-card lp-pain-card--stagger-1">
            <div class="lp-pain-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-heading text-base">Does it happen more than twice a month?</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">If not, it doesn't need an SOP. Just do it or delegate it live.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-pain-card lp-pain-card--stagger-2">
            <div class="lp-pain-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-heading text-base">Does it follow the same steps most of the time?</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">If not, document the common path and list the rest as exceptions.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-pain-card lp-pain-card--stagger-3">
            <div class="lp-pain-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-heading text-base">Can a trained person do it without a law license or your judgment?</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">If not, keep it. That's attorney work.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-pain-card" style="animation: lpSlideIn 0.5s ease 0.55s both;">
            <div class="lp-pain-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-heading text-base">If it were done wrong, would you find out within a day?</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">If not, add a check step to the SOP before you hand it off.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lp-quote-banner mt-14 max-w-3xl mx-auto reveal">
        &ldquo;Four yes answers: write the SOP and hand it off this week. Two or fewer: keep it for now.&rdquo;
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       FIVE FIELDS, THAT IS THE WHOLE SOP
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-500 via-brand-gold to-brand-blue"></div>
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="text-center mb-12 reveal">
        <span class="badge bg-brand-navy/10 text-brand-navy border-brand-navy/15 mb-4">The Format</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-gray-900 mb-4">
          Five fields. That is the whole SOP.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          The format is the same for all ten. Once your staff has read two of them, they can follow any of them.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 reveal mb-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-navy/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-navy font-heading font-bold">1</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 mb-1">Trigger</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">What starts the process. If you can't name it, the process won't start without you.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-navy/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-navy font-heading font-bold">2</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 mb-1">Steps</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Numbered, in order, each one an action with a verb. Seven or fewer. More means two SOPs.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-navy/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-navy font-heading font-bold">3</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 mb-1">Done looks like</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">The observable end state. How the person knows to stop, and how you know to check.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-navy/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-navy font-heading font-bold">4</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-gray-900 mb-1">Exceptions</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Three to five situations where they stop and come to you. This field is where delegation actually happens.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lp-rule-box max-w-3xl mx-auto reveal mb-10 text-center">
        <span class="lp-rule-box-label">Field 5 &middot; Owner</span>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-heading text-brand-navy">One name. Not a role, a person. And the backup when that person is out.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="lp-quote-banner max-w-2xl mx-auto reveal">
        &ldquo;The exceptions field is the only one most people get wrong, because they list too few.&rdquo;
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       THE TEN, IN ORDER
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy via-brand-900 to-brand-950"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-20 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-gold/8 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-brand-blue/8 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-10 reveal">
        <span class="badge bg-brand-gold/15 text-brand-gold border-brand-gold/20 mb-4">The Ten</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-white mb-5">
          Write these first, <span class="text-gradient-gold">in this order.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Intake and follow-up first, because that's where the money leaks. Then client communication. Then records and deadlines, because that's where the risk lives. Two SOPs a week for five weeks and the firm is documented.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto reveal mb-14">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 py-5 border-b border-white/10">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:w-48 flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-brand-blue/20 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-blue font-heading font-bold flex-shrink-0">1&ndash;3</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-bold text-brand-blue uppercase tracking-widest">Intake</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h3 class="text-white font-heading text-base mb-1">New lead intake, lead follow-up, consult scheduling</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">The three that turn a call into a signed, scheduled client.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 py-5 border-b border-white/10">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:w-48 flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-brand-gold/20 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-gold font-heading font-bold flex-shrink-0">4&ndash;6</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-bold text-brand-gold uppercase tracking-widest">Opening The Case</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h3 class="text-white font-heading text-base mb-1">New matter setup, client welcome plan, records request</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">The first 72 hours of a matter, standardized.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 py-5 border-b border-white/10">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:w-48 flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-heading font-bold flex-shrink-0">7&ndash;9</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Running The Case</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h3 class="text-white font-heading text-base mb-1">Status updates, document assembly, deadline management</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">The work that keeps clients from calling, and keeps deadlines off your desk.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 py-5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:w-48 flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-heading font-bold flex-shrink-0">10</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Money</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h3 class="text-white font-heading text-base mb-1">Billing and invoice follow-up</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">The one most owners avoid writing down, and the one that pays for itself fastest.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 reveal mb-6">
        <div class="lp-stat-box lp-stat-box--highlight">
          <div class="lp-stat-box-num lp-stat-box-num--gold">97%</div>
          <p class="lp-stat-box-label">Answer rate 24/7, up from 82%</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-stat-box lp-stat-box--highlight">
          <div class="lp-stat-box-num lp-stat-box-num--gold">15 min</div>
          <p class="lp-stat-box-label">Max speed to lead, down from 34</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-stat-box lp-stat-box--highlight">
          <div class="lp-stat-box-num lp-stat-box-num--gold">6</div>
          <p class="lp-stat-box-label">Follow-up touches in 3 days</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-stat-box lp-stat-box--highlight">
          <div class="lp-stat-box-num lp-stat-box-num--gold">109</div>
          <p class="lp-stat-box-label">Cases signed by one staff member in 30 days</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center text-xs text-gray-500 mb-10 reveal">Attorney Assistant client figures, real client files, identities protected.</p>

      <div class="text-center reveal">
        <a href="#book-now" class="btn-primary btn-lg group inline-flex">
          Find Your First SOP
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M3 10a.75.75 0 01.75-.75h10.638L10.23 5.29a.75.75 0 111.04-1.08l5.5 5.25a.75.75 0 010 1.08l-5.5 5.25a.75.75 0 11-1.04-1.08l4.158-3.96H3.75A.75.75 0 013 10z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       DO THE TASK ONCE, OUT LOUD
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gray-950 lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[800px] h-[800px] bg-brand-gold/5 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10 text-center">
